// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// N0VA HEALTH — PATIENT HEALTH DATA WALLET
// Policy-enforcing privacy control plane. HL7 FHIR Consent, HIPAA access/
// amendment/restriction/accounting, GDPR erasure/restriction/portability.
